sequenceDiagram
  participant O as Overseer
  participant C as Copies 1..N (default 3, no shared context)
  participant V as Source verifier
  participant J as Blind judge
  participant G as Gateway
  O->>C: same goal + rubric
  C-->>O: answers with claims + source URLs
  O->>V: verify each URL
  V-->>O: supported / not supported / unreachable
  O->>J: answers shuffled, no writer ID, no brain name
  J-->>O: scores per rubric
  O->>O: build result claim by claim (disputed: one targeted check)
  O->>G: report: verified / agreed only / disputed
